            "open_state_content_bg": "#fefaff",
            "open_state_content_text": "#121212",
            "content": "<p>Using <strong>HOSFU</strong> is simple:</p><ol><li>Turn on the device and wait for it to <strong>warm up</strong>.</li><li>Take a deep breath.</li><li>Blow steadily into the <strong>mouthpiece</strong>.</li><li>Read your <strong>BAC result</strong> on the digital screen.</li><li>If the number is not where you want it to be, <strong>wait, retest later, or choose a safer ride</strong>.</li></ol><p>Best used before driving home from <strong>dinner, parties, bars, BBQs, holidays</strong>, or the <strong>morning after drinking</strong>.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0
