            "content": "<p>Responsible drivers know that <strong>“feeling fine” is not proof</strong>.</p><p>Many people keep <strong>HOSFU</strong> in their <strong>car, kitchen drawer, travel bag, or bar cabinet</strong> so they can check before making a risky decision.</p><p>It is especially useful for:</p><p>• <strong>Nights out with friends</strong><br/>• <strong>Dinner dates and wine nights</strong><br/>• <strong>Weekend BBQs and holidays</strong><br/>• <strong>Rides home after events</strong><br/>• <strong>Morning-after checks</strong> before work or errands<br/>• Families who want an extra <strong>safety step before anyone drives</strong></p>",
